  "title": "St. Paddy's Day Leftover Corned Beef Casserole",
  "description": "Corned beef baked with sauerkraut, Swiss cheese, and refrigerated biscuit dough makes this an impressive casserole for St. Patrick's day leftovers.",
  "authors": [
    "Marlene"
  ],
